<title>CHINA: HK HANG SENG SETS RECORD CLOSE ON RECORD TURNOVER.</title>
<headline>HK HANG SENG SETS RECORD CLOSE ON RECORD TURNOVER.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Hang Seng Index continued its record-breaking run on Thursday, climbing 131.67 points, or 0.80 percent to a record close of 16,673.27.</p>
<p>The index set an all time record high of 16,820.31 in the afternoon trade.</p>
<p>Turnover expanded to a record HK$34.2 billion, higher still than Wednesday's HK$31.85 billion.</p>
</text>
